{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_03",
  "title": "临时停车",
  "storyCode": "RS-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c31d59186439dc3c61123c2e84e04b53a26554c42393b57606a2feb95e37289a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "各位乘客，本次列车到达终点站——\n银心湖站。\n银心湖地处盆地中央，湖面雾霭氤氲，水质清澈，是谢拉格土地上孕育出的众多瑰宝之一。\n传说银心湖是耶拉冈德落下的第一滴眼泪，在冬季，您可以于冰封的湖面上漫步，透过冰面，还可以观赏冰层深处的风景。\n而最新建起的耶拉冈德像伫立于银心湖的湖心岛之上，耶拉冈德在此，注视着谢拉格与其子民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "各位乘客，本次列车......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......所以，一切都是误会？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "没有隐情，没有追杀，没有什么可能在车上的重要人物，什么都没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "如果你指的是让我登上这趟列车的“重要人物”，那就是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "短短一个月就在牧民间扬名，擅长医治驮兽的哈洛德·克雷加文子爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我的荣幸，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "请您原谅，锏女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "您手套上的血迹，实在令人难以不多做一些设想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "血迹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你很在意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "这么在意，告诉你也无妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "洗耳恭听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "莉莉生产时的情况不是很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "突然早产，出血量很大，费了我不少功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "早产......出血量还不少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这可不是小事，锏女士，莉莉她现在情况如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我替她做了应急处理，但后续的护理还需要专业人士来做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "老雷昂指名说最信得过你，克雷加文。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "之后就要看你的本事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "好！我立刻就赶过去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你现在的表情有点遗憾。怎么，不符合你的想象？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "没关系，我不介意让你的想象成真。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "这就不必了，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "说说看，你们都误会了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这个......哈哈，银心湖真是个不错的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "今天的天气也不错，风和日丽，空气清新......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......维多利亚人连转移话题都要谈论天气？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "这种套话我听过一万次，腻了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "请您见谅，在维多利亚，我们会从小学习如何靠我们糟糕的天气来开启话题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "请您不要随便抹黑维多利亚的形象，子爵阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "喂——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你们怎么还在这傻站着聊天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不就是有点小误会吗，你们说开了没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "当然，当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "如果不是某些人危言耸听，也不至于产生这样的误会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "行吧，你们都解决了就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "虽然在列车上跑跑挺有趣的，但我不想再蹲在桌子底下吃灰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "对了，我刚刚去前面看了看，那边有导游姐姐指路，我还要了两张地图来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这儿离银心湖就一条街的距离，方便得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "怎么说，我们现在出发？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这......我很抱歉，罗莎琳，我无法兑现之前的承诺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "现在有一位更加需要我的女士，我必须尽快赶到她的身边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......莉莉真的是驮兽吧？不是什么，维多利亚贵族的黑话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我求您！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "行了，知道了，你还是赶紧去看看那位“莉莉女士”吧，我这没啥，我自己一个人完全没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "罗莎琳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你、你怎么了，干嘛这副表情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你真是个善解人意的好姑娘！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "来，让我们先交换一下联络方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "如果遇到困难，随时可以联系我，哈洛德乐意为你效劳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "还有你的父亲......谢拉格美男子，对吧？我也会帮你留意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那就多谢了，大叔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你们继续聊吧，我先走了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "唉，多好的孩子，刚刚失去母亲，却还能如此乐观，如此坚强......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......谢拉格美男子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "啊，您听到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "罗莎琳这孩子这趟来谢拉格，就是想要找到多年未见的父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "真是感人，希望她能一切顺利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "父亲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "那个女孩是这么说的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "既然误会已经解开，那......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "锏女士，我是您忠实的支持者，不知可否赏脸签名——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "没空。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "先走了，你记得照顾好莉莉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哎，且慢，请留步，锏女士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......这就走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我们的黑骑士女士看起来并不喜欢那段辉煌的过往经历。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "这也难怪，她毕竟是以那样的方式被卡西米尔驱逐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哦，不好意思，原来你还在这。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我不想随意发言，惹怒那位黑骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "很有自知之明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "发言确实应当更加谨慎，这是我的失误。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "不过，子爵阁下，您当真相信锏女士给出的理由？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "黑骑士自脱离卡西米尔，跟随希瓦艾什前往谢拉格以来，一直都是其手下的心腹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "据我所知，这位女士最近一段时间，都在某座山中，为喀兰贸易训练一批新式部队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "而近期我们的人发现，谢拉格与外界的进出口交易频繁，特别是在一些敏感的材料方面，交易数额都有些异常......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......所以呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "一切都还只是我的推测，阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "但我想，您应当也是有所怀疑，所以才会留下那位罗莎琳小姐的联系方式，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "看来在维多利亚的工作经历让你得了无法信任他人的病，我替你感到遗憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "职责所在，还请见谅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "今天发生的事，我会向公爵阁下如实汇报。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "慢着......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "容我再次提醒您，子爵阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "请记住您身负的职责，不要辜负公爵阁下的期望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "这并非一场观光之旅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "关于与喀兰贸易的合作，不知泰勒先生考虑得如何了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "角峰已经带您参观过喀兰贸易旗下的矿场与工厂，您对谢拉格和喀兰贸易是否满意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "text": "对希瓦艾什先生您的公司，我自然是满意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "text": "只不过，希瓦艾什先生，您也是生意人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "text": "我想您一定能理解，这样大的项目，若是与喀兰贸易合作，我自然不会如此犹豫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "text": "但要说与谢拉格官方合作......大家对谢拉格的了解也还不深，许多事情，我还是需要更加慎重地考虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "这是当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "text": "前些天，我还在街上瞧见了维多利亚的士兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "text": "希瓦艾什先生，谢拉格与维多利亚......该不会闹什么矛盾吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "我可以向您保证，您在谢拉格的安全不会受到任何威胁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "您可以慢慢考虑，泰勒先生。谢拉格不会令您失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚富商",
      "text": "那是再好不过了！希望我们能合作愉快，希瓦艾什先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "角峰，明天你继续带泰勒先生参观。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "正常范围内的需求，都可以满足对方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......不过老爷，我们真的要与这位泰勒先生合作吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "你认为他不是一个好的合作对象？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "属下不敢擅自评判。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "只不过，这位先生在谢拉格的这段时间，一次次推脱合约签署，在利润分配上反口了数次，恐怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "你说得不错，泰勒先生是一位精明的商人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "现在的谢拉格只能与这些嗅觉敏锐的精明商人合作，而他们，却有不止一个选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "让谢拉格成为他们的唯一选项，就是今后我要做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "老爷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "角峰，你先去看看锏的新兵队伍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "让他们护卫泰勒先生出行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "text": "难得你会用通讯器，我以为你很讨厌这种远程联络？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我只是讨厌别人联系我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯，有件事我想你该知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我在去银心湖的列车上遇到了个罗德岛来的丫头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你和罗德岛又有什么新合作了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "瞧一瞧看一看！特制谢拉格雪花干酪，大号驮兽摆件，精美圣女画像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "谢拉格特产应有尽有了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "竞争商家",
      "text": "最新款驮兽盲盒发售！数量有限，欢迎选购！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嚯，好热闹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "让我看看，这都卖的什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这圣女画像画的什么啊，初雪怎么被画成这样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "哎，小姑娘怎么说话呢，这画像可是咱们圣女大人亲自过目的，保真！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "行，保真。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "老板，给我来一个那个什么雪花干酪，这就是现在最热门的特产？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "说不定我小时候其实吃过呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "哎小妹，你也是谢拉格人啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "嗐，早说嘛，那你别买那个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "那个是卖给外国游客的，咱们用不着买那个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "我给你拿点这种碎干酪，味道不差，吃这个就行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你们这店......这不是坑外国人嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "怎么能这么说呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "小妹，你看这雪花干酪，看看这包装，多好看多有品位啊，游客买特产嘛，不就图一个高端上档次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "我就是多赚点包装费，又不是以次充好，干酪味道肯定是有保证的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......有点道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那就给我来点这个碎干酪吧，顺便，老板，和你打听个事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "咱们谢拉格有没有什么大家公认的美男子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "美男子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "这......虽然咱是佩尔罗契家的人，但这事我可得说老实话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "要说咱们谢拉格公认的第一美男子，那应该得是恩希欧迪斯老爷吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯......呃，银灰？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "对对，就是希瓦艾什家的那位当家人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不可能。对，绝对不可能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "老板，再换一个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "呃，那......那......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "算了算了，随口问问罢了，就当个玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "问你个别的事，关于银心湖旁边那座山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "就那边那座，那座山有什么说法没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "哦！那个啊，那是弗根山啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "那可是咱们这块有名的定情圣地，年轻小情侣啊，都喜欢往那去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "小情侣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "现在还整了什么宣传语，哎哟什么“一起看日出就能永远在一起”咯，什么“情定谢拉格坚如寒冰”咯，啧啧，肉麻的嘞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "好多游客都爱往上跑，要挂什么证明感情的金锁......哎，对了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "听说阿克托斯老爷挺爱上山打猎，好几次被游客打扰了，还很不高兴呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "行，我知道了，谢了老板，这是干酪的钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "text": "谢谢惠顾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这就是妈妈经常提起的银心湖......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "还有那座山，弗根山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "风景确实还不错，嗯，不过这种程度的冰湖乌萨斯也不是没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哟，冰层还挺厚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那边那个看不清脸的......就是耶拉冈德像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "哇哦，好高，好大的工程，这么大的雕像真不知道得用掉多少石头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "石头？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我们的耶拉冈德像可没有那么简单！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "你这人还挺懂欣赏的嘛，这里可是观赏耶拉冈德像最好的地点了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呃，你哪位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我是——\n咳、咳嗯！我是谁不重要，重要的是你刚刚说的话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "这座耶拉冈德像才不是用普通石头建造的，为表示对耶拉冈德的敬爱，我们用的材料可都是最高等级的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "最高等级？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "具体是指啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "哎呀都说了最高等级，当然就是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "——呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "怎么了，咬到舌头了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "这种事当然是要保密了，怎么能轻易告诉游客呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "关于材料，详细的我不能告诉你，但总之......总之很厉害就对了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你刚刚不是还差点说漏嘴了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "我最后没说出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好好，你没说出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那你慢慢在这欣赏，我先走了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "啊，喂！你等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "还有啥事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你......\n呃，对了！你是游客吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "两天后的早晨，就在这里，会举办耶拉冈德像的落成仪式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "如果那时候你还在谢拉格，一定要记得来观礼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你怎么这么自说自话啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "两天后的事情还说不定呢，现在看看不也一样吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "那怎么能一样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "那可是圣女大人会亲自出席主持的仪式，搞不好真能看到耶拉冈德显灵呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "你......对了，你叫什么名字？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "罗莎琳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "全名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这么麻烦......\n（乌萨斯语）罗莎琳·塔季扬诺夫娜·拉里娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "好，罗莎琳！我邀请你！这样行不行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "我休露丝·布朗陶正式邀请你，罗莎琳·塔季扬诺夫娜·拉里娜！参加两天后的耶拉冈德像落成仪式！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "到时候你就会知道，这座耶拉冈德像是最特别的，和其他的都不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这么有自信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好啊，那我就拭目以待了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "哎，等等，我还没给你邀请函呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "这家伙......跑这么快干嘛啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "休露丝，布朗陶家家主的妹妹，近年来作为使节频繁代表谢拉格出使他国。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "难道说，罗莎琳是她从中安排的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "应该想办法窃听的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "先生，你已经拿着你的破报纸在我的摊位面前站了五分钟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "你要是不买东西的话能不能让让。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "哦，抱歉，请给我来一杯驮兽奶茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "这样应该就算完成菈塔托丝那个臭女人的吩咐了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "忽然要我盯着个小丫头，还要想办法继续接触对方......莫名其妙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "不过，这小丫头，仔细一看还真是有点眼熟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "露丝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "真的不用我帮忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "尤卡坦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "事情交给我，你还有什么不放心的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "走，我们回去，我可要好好问问菈塔托丝，这个叫罗莎琳的小丫头到底是什么来头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
